        },
        "summary": "A4 (texted sign-up): check the texted code (and the mailed one when sign-up asked for it). Right: the first session. Answers 409 SIGNUP_CHANNEL_DISABLED while codes are mailed.",
        "tags": [
          "Auth",
          "app"
        ]
